OL,3,GNEWSANandy joins BT workers' jobs
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa Nandy MP has joined BT workers
OL,7,Fprotesting outside the Labour
OL,8,FConference against plans to close the
OL,9,Fcompany's Liverpool office and relocate
OL,10,Fabout 600 jobs.
OL,12,FBT is due to shut its Old Hall Street
OL,13,Foffice in March 2027 when the lease
OL,14,Fruns out.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
