OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANandy joins BT workers' jobs
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State for Digital,
OL,7,FCulture, Media and Sport said the
OL,8,Fgovernment was trying to find a
OL,9,Fresolution to keep the jobs in
OL,10,FLiverpool. She said workers were doing
OL,11,Fan "outstanding job" and that keeping
OL,12,Fthe roles in the city would support
OL,13,FLiverpool's ambition to become a "world
OL,14,Fleader in telecommunications".
OL,16,FBT said the changes were part of a
OL,17,Fwider programme to "bring more
OL,18,Fcolleagues together in fewer,
OL,19,Fbetter-equipped locations".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
